  m_text: 'ALL WINS SHOWS IN COINS. ALL LINES ARE PLAYED FOR A LINE COST OF 30 COINS.
    CHOOSE YOUR TOTAL BET. TOTAL BET IS THE LINE COST MULTIPLIED BY BET MULTIPLIER.
    HIGHEST WIN ONLY ON EACH LINE. WINS ON DIFFERENT LINES ARE ADDED. LINE WINS MULTIPLIED
    BY BET MULTIPLIER.

    SCATTER WINS ARE ADDED TO LINE WINS

    SCATTER WINS
    ARE MULTIPLIED BY THE BET MULTIPLIER. WHILE THE REELS ARE SPINNING YOU MAY SELECT
    THE SPIN BUTTON TO STOP THEM.

    SELECT THE SPIN BUTTON OR PRESS SPACEBAR (IF
    APPLICABLE) TO BEGIN THE GAME.'
